# Allowlist: only the code and prompt templates are tracked.
# Source PDFs, extracted text, chunks, prompts rendered with text, model outputs and
# annotations must never be committed (copyrighted translations / unpublished work).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!*.py
!run_prompts.sbatch
!parsers/
!parsers/*.py
!prompts/
!prompts/*.txt
